WEBVTT

00:11.410 --> 00:12.540
Nadeshiko.

00:13.620 --> 00:15.950
We'll be landing in Waleland momentarily.

00:16.830 --> 00:18.330
Finally...

00:20.660 --> 00:22.080
How's Kaede?

00:25.540 --> 00:27.000
I will not give up.

00:27.000 --> 00:29.790
I will persuade Kaede no matter what.

00:29.790 --> 00:32.080
Rock 'n' ro!

00:33.320 --> 00:38.650
I kept drawing rainbow colours over and over

00:33.320 --> 00:38.650
hitasura kaiteta niji no iro

00:38.650 --> 00:43.150
Seven colours are not enough

00:38.650 --> 00:43.150
mou nanairo ja tarinai kara

00:43.150 --> 00:48.820
Everyday leaps over the "usual" and enters a new chapter

00:43.150 --> 00:46.150
mainichi wa sude ni itsumo wo

00:46.150 --> 00:48.820
tobikoete shinshou nano sa

00:48.820 --> 00:54.820
The story is going beyond

00:48.820 --> 00:54.820
monogatari wa haruka kanata e

00:58.990 --> 01:04.320
The bell toll in my heart

00:58.990 --> 01:04.320
kokoro de naridasu kane no ne ga

01:04.320 --> 01:08.650
is getting louder bit by bit

01:04.320 --> 01:08.650
sukoshi zutsu ookiku natte yuku

01:08.650 --> 01:12.150
Believe in the excitement

01:08.650 --> 01:12.150
sono takanari wo shinjite

01:12.150 --> 01:14.650
And take one step forward

01:12.150 --> 01:14.650
ippo wo fumidaseta nara

01:14.650 --> 01:21.980
It'll give me more power than I ever imagined

01:14.650 --> 01:21.980
souzou ijouno chikara ni kawatteru yo

01:20.320 --> 01:22.980
Can't be for sure

01:20.320 --> 01:22.980
zettai nante nai

01:21.980 --> 01:24.650
Nothing

01:21.980 --> 01:24.650
nanimo

01:22.980 --> 01:25.650
There's no guarantee

01:22.980 --> 01:25.650
kakushin wa dekinai

01:24.650 --> 01:27.320
No one

01:24.650 --> 01:27.320
daremo

01:25.650 --> 01:28.320
But I won't give up

01:25.650 --> 01:28.320
demo akiramenai

01:27.320 --> 01:29.980
That's why

01:27.320 --> 01:29.980
dakara

01:28.320 --> 01:30.480
I can still move forward

01:28.320 --> 01:30.480
susundeku koto ga

01:30.310 --> 01:31.820
I can still move forward

01:30.310 --> 01:31.820
dekiru yo

01:31.820 --> 01:37.650
Because there's magic right in here

01:31.820 --> 01:37.650
koko ni wa mahou ga aru kara

01:37.650 --> 01:43.980
It started to be brighter than the stars

01:37.650 --> 01:43.980
datte hoshi yori kagayaki dashita no ni

01:43.980 --> 01:48.650
I can't stop now

01:43.980 --> 01:48.650
tachidomareru hazu mo nai kara

01:48.650 --> 01:54.320
It entered into a new era

01:48.650 --> 01:54.320
jidai wa tsui ni atarashii makuake wo mukaeta no sa

01:54.320 --> 01:58.650
Placing this overflowing feelings into this gem

01:54.320 --> 01:58.650
afureta omoi wo kiseki ni komete

01:58.650 --> 02:02.320
And go beyond the future

01:58.650 --> 02:02.320
saki no hou e

02:07.870 --> 02:10.910
So many interesting things!

02:10.910 --> 02:12.450
What do you think?

02:12.450 --> 02:14.660
They look great on you!

02:14.660 --> 02:17.250
Do they have any kind of magic?

02:17.250 --> 02:20.330
These... apparently have analyzing abilities.

02:21.620 --> 02:25.620
You're 156 finches tall,
you weigh 45 stones,

02:25.620 --> 02:26.830
Your bust is eighty...

02:26.830 --> 02:28.700
Rose, wait!

02:28.700 --> 02:29.910
I'm kidding.

02:29.910 --> 02:31.700
Ugh, forget you!

02:32.950 --> 02:34.660
Hello.

02:33.780 --> 02:34.660
Oh!

02:34.660 --> 02:37.000
You're Yue-san from supernova!

02:40.540 --> 02:42.700
I saw your Orchestra the other day!

02:42.700 --> 02:44.950
It was absolutely wonderful!

02:44.950 --> 02:48.620
Getting a compliment from you
doesn't exactly make me happy.

02:48.620 --> 02:53.330
Um... Do you have any advice
for bettering our grades? We're—

02:53.330 --> 02:56.540
Your group is on the brink
of getting expelled, isn't it?

02:56.540 --> 02:58.160
Huh?

02:58.160 --> 03:01.500
Don't you feel bad for Eliza-sama,
being such a disgrace?

03:09.540 --> 03:10.580
Are you all right?

03:12.040 --> 03:14.870
That was out of nowhere,
so I was a bit shocked.

03:14.870 --> 03:18.200
But it's hard to believe
Yue-san would say things like that.

03:18.200 --> 03:20.000
Do you two know each other?

03:20.000 --> 03:24.620
No... But it looks like she knows me.

03:24.620 --> 03:27.040
Apparently so.

03:27.040 --> 03:28.040
Oh?

03:29.580 --> 03:31.000
Do you know her?

03:31.000 --> 03:35.620
That's Kaede.
She's an exchange student from Yamato.

03:35.620 --> 03:36.790
Welcome back!

03:38.120 --> 03:39.290
Rosetta-san!

03:39.290 --> 03:40.700
When did you get back?

03:40.700 --> 03:44.750
Just a moment ago. Um... May I ask who that is?

03:44.750 --> 03:47.080
She's a new student.

03:47.080 --> 03:48.620
I'm Tiara!

03:48.620 --> 03:51.580
It's nice to meet you. I'm Kaede.

03:51.580 --> 03:52.950
Pleasure to meet you.

03:52.950 --> 03:54.290
Likewise.

03:54.290 --> 03:56.250
What kind of shop is this?

03:56.250 --> 03:58.160
They sell divination items here.

03:58.160 --> 04:00.540
Kaede belongs to the Divination Club.

04:00.540 --> 04:02.370
Ah...

04:02.370 --> 04:05.950
Come to think of it,
you're not in a club yet, Tia.

04:05.950 --> 04:09.660
Really? Then would you like to join mine?

04:09.660 --> 04:11.950
You're not in a club either, are you, Rose?

04:11.950 --> 04:14.160
Well, I have work.

04:14.160 --> 04:18.750
But if you're planning to join one,
you should really give it some thought.

04:18.750 --> 04:23.410
Yes... You should really give it some thought.

04:23.410 --> 04:25.750
Is something wrong?

04:25.750 --> 04:29.120
Well, Nadeshiko...

04:27.700 --> 04:29.120
Kaede!

04:30.290 --> 04:33.750
You went too far ahead. Oh?

04:33.750 --> 04:35.660
Welcome back, Nadeshiko.

04:35.660 --> 04:37.250
This is a new student at our school, Tiara.

04:38.660 --> 04:40.790
Oh, I see.

04:40.790 --> 04:44.950
I'm Kaede's older sister
Nadeshiko. Rock 'n' ro!

04:44.950 --> 04:46.370
Rock 'n' ro?

04:47.830 --> 04:50.580
I absolutely love rock and roll.

04:50.580 --> 04:53.700
Please stop being so weird
towards someone you just met.

04:54.830 --> 04:56.040
Kaede!

04:58.040 --> 05:01.450
Well, I hope to see you at school soon!

05:01.450 --> 05:03.620
Uh... sure.

05:17.160 --> 05:19.830
Why aren't you changing, Lavie?

05:19.830 --> 05:23.160
No reason. Just because.

05:23.160 --> 05:25.290
Your uniform will wrinkle if you sleep in them.

05:25.290 --> 05:27.200
Well, that's not good.

05:27.200 --> 05:29.080
I'm gonna go change!

05:29.080 --> 05:30.500
I wonder what's gotten into her.

05:32.290 --> 05:34.580
Oh? Tsubaki-san?

05:36.160 --> 05:37.830
Good evening.

05:37.830 --> 05:39.450
You're back.

05:39.450 --> 05:41.120
It's been a while.

05:41.120 --> 05:43.250
You all seem well.

05:45.120 --> 05:46.710
Are you Tiara?

05:46.710 --> 05:47.620
Yes.

05:47.620 --> 05:50.410
I'm the oldest of the three sisters, Tsubaki.

05:50.410 --> 05:52.120
Three sisters?

05:52.120 --> 05:54.160
She's Nadeshiko and Kaede's older sister.

05:55.370 --> 05:57.040
It's a pleasure to make your acquaintance.

05:57.040 --> 05:59.500
Were you able to get out of your rut?

05:59.500 --> 06:03.250
Well, we did have a breakthrough, but...

06:03.250 --> 06:05.950
Tsubaki and her sisters also perform Orchestras.

06:05.950 --> 06:08.000
You mean just like supernova?

06:08.000 --> 06:12.290
Yes, exactly. But we haven't been
able to wow the crowd lately...

06:12.290 --> 06:15.000
I heard that you went on
a journey to find yourselves!

06:15.000 --> 06:17.120
We just went back home for a while.

06:17.120 --> 06:21.120
But that's where Nadeshiko
discovered something new for us.

06:21.120 --> 06:24.450
But Kaede refuses to join in.

06:24.450 --> 06:26.700
I'm trying to get them to reconcile, but...

06:29.330 --> 06:33.290
I heard that you're trying
to figure out what club to join.

06:33.290 --> 06:35.040
Huh? Yes...?

06:35.040 --> 06:38.750
Then would you mind helping me out a bit?

06:41.000 --> 06:43.080
Observing various clubs?

06:43.080 --> 06:44.120
Really?

06:44.120 --> 06:47.500
Yes. I want you two to help her out.

06:47.500 --> 06:49.290
Us?

06:49.290 --> 06:50.950
You want them to go with you, don't you?

06:50.950 --> 06:56.120
Um... I'm very interested in
divination and rock...

06:56.120 --> 06:57.370
Really?!

06:57.370 --> 07:00.450
And I was curious about a lot of other things...

07:00.450 --> 07:01.560
Of course!

07:01.560 --> 07:03.450
Let's go right away!

07:03.450 --> 07:05.450
I'm counting on you girls.

07:05.450 --> 07:08.700
You're not coming with us, Tsubaki?

07:08.700 --> 07:11.620
Unfortunately, I'm a bit busy.

07:11.620 --> 07:14.790
I'd go with you girls if I could.

07:14.790 --> 07:16.790
You must care a lot about your sisters.

07:16.790 --> 07:19.660
That's not... exactly the case.

07:19.660 --> 07:22.500
She's just a weirdo with
an extreme sister complex.

07:22.500 --> 07:26.450
That's so mean! I'm just ever
so worried about my little sisters...

07:33.120 --> 07:35.080
These are mine!

07:35.080 --> 07:36.870
Aw...

07:36.870 --> 07:39.620
That's okay. I have another.

07:39.620 --> 07:41.700
And over here, I have Nadeshiko's.

07:41.700 --> 07:43.250
Tsubaki?!

07:43.250 --> 07:44.750
Give that back!

07:44.750 --> 07:46.500
What do you think you're doing?!

07:48.450 --> 07:49.870
Tsubaki!

07:49.870 --> 07:55.950
I must say... I rather enjoy watching
my little sisters act so... desperately.

07:49.870 --> 07:52.120
Give that back!

08:01.370 --> 08:03.660
I guess there are all kinds of divination.

08:03.660 --> 08:05.910
Would you like me to tell your fortune?

08:05.910 --> 08:07.830
Her divination is spot on!

08:07.830 --> 08:11.120
Kaede is an absolute divination fanatic.

08:11.120 --> 08:13.870
Like you can talk...

08:16.370 --> 08:18.540
Let's rock!

08:18.540 --> 08:21.700
You've surpassed being a fanatic
and you're just a weirdo.

08:21.700 --> 08:24.580
Did I do anything weird?

08:24.580 --> 08:26.660
Welcome to MIT!

08:26.660 --> 08:28.450
MIT?

08:28.450 --> 08:31.200
The Magic Item Invention Team.

08:31.200 --> 08:33.040
Enjoy your stay.

08:33.040 --> 08:35.250
Is that a magic item, too?

08:35.250 --> 08:39.910
That board is able to relay
the owner's thoughts and feelings vocally.

08:39.910 --> 08:42.080
Mary-san made it herself!

08:43.540 --> 08:47.580
It's even on the market!
It's called a Berry Board!

08:47.580 --> 08:50.000
It's not very popular for some reason though...

08:50.000 --> 08:51.910
Well, you know...

08:51.910 --> 08:54.120
We don't actually need it.

08:59.750 --> 09:01.000
All right!

09:01.000 --> 09:02.750
Now, strip!

09:03.750 --> 09:04.750
Hiyah!

09:06.160 --> 09:07.330
Yes!

09:08.580 --> 09:11.080
It's my turn now. Die!

09:14.200 --> 09:17.080
Welcome to the Cabaret, Onee-sama!

09:17.080 --> 09:18.950
Okay, say, "Ah."

09:21.620 --> 09:23.000
Cabaret?

09:23.000 --> 09:24.790
This is the Cabaret Club...

09:32.500 --> 09:33.870
It's so lovely!

09:36.540 --> 09:39.790
Is this... Shiny Sand?

09:39.790 --> 09:41.290
Yes, it is.

09:41.290 --> 09:44.160
Plants grow better when
there's Shiny Sand in the soil.

09:44.160 --> 09:46.540
You know a lot about this, Tiara. Well done.

09:46.540 --> 09:49.540
Um, is this...?

09:49.540 --> 09:51.870
Yes, it's a Shiny Stone ore.

09:51.870 --> 09:54.250
We shatter that and mix it into the soil.

09:54.250 --> 09:56.580
I think I can use this in my divination.

09:56.580 --> 09:58.580
I got it in the forest northeast from here.

09:58.580 --> 10:01.790
Apparently, there are
even bigger ones further in...

10:01.790 --> 10:03.160
I'd love to get some!

10:03.160 --> 10:08.040
Absolutely not! There are Magical Monsters
that appear around there.

10:08.040 --> 10:09.200
But...

10:09.200 --> 10:11.160
No means no!

10:12.540 --> 10:16.080
This doesn't concern you, Nadeshiko.

10:16.080 --> 10:17.330
Kaede...

10:18.500 --> 10:21.790
So... What other kinds of flowers do you have?

10:21.790 --> 10:24.120
Well, for rarer breeds, we have geraniums.

10:24.120 --> 10:25.830
Really?!

10:25.830 --> 10:30.200
Wow! That's amazing! I've never
seen the real thing before!

10:31.910 --> 10:34.660
So where should we go next?

10:34.660 --> 10:37.660
Actually, I'm sure we've seen enough.

10:37.660 --> 10:38.830
Huh?

10:38.830 --> 10:42.950
You seemed to really enjoy Gardening Club.

10:42.950 --> 10:44.910
Was I that obvious?

10:44.910 --> 10:48.080
I really love flowers!

10:48.080 --> 10:52.620
After seeing everyone so passionate
about their clubs, it just made me realize

10:52.620 --> 10:54.790
just how much I love rock!

10:54.790 --> 10:58.790
And that I can't wait to sing
my perfection of rock!

10:58.790 --> 11:00.750
You already have a new song?

11:00.750 --> 11:02.700
I even have the choreography figured out!

11:04.160 --> 11:07.250
Then do whatever you want.

11:07.250 --> 11:11.700
Do whatever kind of music
you want with Tsubaki!

11:10.250 --> 11:11.700
Kaede!

11:11.700 --> 11:13.040
I'll go after her!

11:24.450 --> 11:27.250
I'm sorry for the sudden intrusion.

11:27.250 --> 11:31.000
Don't even worry about it.
Let's sleep together tonight.

11:31.000 --> 11:32.450
Okay.

11:33.870 --> 11:37.200
You can talk to me if there's
anything troubling you, okay?

11:37.200 --> 11:38.700
Tiara-san...

11:40.700 --> 11:43.540
Will you be my older sister?

11:43.540 --> 11:44.580
Huh?!

11:44.580 --> 11:46.000
Absolutely not!

11:46.000 --> 11:47.370
Why'd you answer?

11:47.370 --> 11:50.790
I, uh... Never mind.

11:52.160 --> 11:56.580
I'm sorry. You just seem
so reliable, so I just...

11:56.580 --> 12:00.250
Tsubaki and Nadeshiko
seem like reliable sisters, too.

12:00.250 --> 12:02.370
They're both just weirdos.

12:02.370 --> 12:08.620
And I just don't understand
why we have to do new music.

12:09.450 --> 12:12.620
We've worked so hard together
up until this point...

12:12.620 --> 12:16.250
Yet they want to change our direction
because we aren't getting enough attention...

12:16.250 --> 12:18.200
What are they even thinking?

12:21.000 --> 12:24.540
I actually have an older sister
that's a witch, too.

12:24.540 --> 12:26.250
You do?

12:26.250 --> 12:31.750
Yes. But my sister was very
against me going to this academy.

12:31.750 --> 12:33.290
She was?

12:33.290 --> 12:38.330
Actually... I fought with her
right before I came here, too.

12:38.330 --> 12:43.830
I'm pretty sure she didn't like the idea of me
becoming a witch after I was sick for so long.

12:43.830 --> 12:45.330
But...

12:45.330 --> 12:49.160
But I want to be an amazing witch
just like my sister.

12:49.160 --> 12:51.080
That's what I decided.

12:51.080 --> 12:56.000
I think that's going to give me
the courage to face my sister head on.

12:57.000 --> 12:58.330
Courage...

13:16.120 --> 13:18.290
You're up early.

13:18.290 --> 13:20.040
Tiara-san.

13:20.040 --> 13:22.500
You can stay here until
you've gathered your thoughts.

13:22.500 --> 13:23.870
Thank you very much.

13:25.000 --> 13:26.910
But I...

13:26.910 --> 13:28.450
Kaede!

13:28.450 --> 13:29.830
Tsubaki.

13:29.830 --> 13:31.160
Is something wrong?

13:31.160 --> 13:33.200
When I woke up, I found this.

13:34.790 --> 13:37.370
"I'm going to the forest."

13:37.370 --> 13:38.540
Wait, is this...

13:38.540 --> 13:40.200
I can't find Nadeshiko anywhere.

13:40.200 --> 13:43.200
Wait, why would she go
after telling you not to...

13:43.200 --> 13:47.870
This isn't for sure, but she
might've gone to look for Shiny Stones.

13:47.870 --> 13:49.120
Shiny Stones?

13:49.120 --> 13:51.750
Because I wanted some...

13:51.750 --> 13:53.040
I see.

13:53.040 --> 13:54.500
That sounds like something she'd do.

13:54.500 --> 13:55.750
Let's go find her!

13:55.750 --> 13:58.830
Calm down. There are
Magical Monsters in that forest.

13:58.830 --> 13:59.830
But...

13:59.830 --> 14:02.660
And the forest itself is really big...

14:05.200 --> 14:06.330
In that case...

14:08.950 --> 14:11.540
I'm sorry to bring you out here so early.

14:11.540 --> 14:15.160
Don't even worry about it!
You and I are buddies!

14:15.160 --> 14:17.750
I wonder if Nadeshiko is all right.

14:17.750 --> 14:19.410
I'm sure she's okay.

14:19.410 --> 14:21.700
Nadeshiko is strong.

14:22.910 --> 14:24.910
Stop!

14:24.910 --> 14:26.700
This smell...

14:37.620 --> 14:38.950
Whoa...

14:55.120 --> 14:58.000
There aren't that many targets I can't hit.

14:59.700 --> 15:01.200
Thanks...

15:01.200 --> 15:04.620
If one of those things got Nadeshiko...

15:06.910 --> 15:09.040
Nadeshiko!

15:18.000 --> 15:20.330
I heard something from over there!

15:20.330 --> 15:21.790
Nadeshiko!

15:21.790 --> 15:22.950
Wait!

15:48.700 --> 15:53.290
Nadeshiko! Nadeshiko!

15:55.160 --> 15:56.700
I'm right here!

16:02.500 --> 16:04.200
Nadeshiko?!

16:04.200 --> 16:06.580
Kaede...

16:06.580 --> 16:08.080
I'll save you right now!

16:15.160 --> 16:16.910
Just wait!

16:16.910 --> 16:18.750
Kaede!

16:18.750 --> 16:19.750
Nadeshiko?!

16:21.290 --> 16:22.540
Take my hand!

16:28.500 --> 16:29.790
One more time!

16:31.870 --> 16:33.290
Please...

16:44.540 --> 16:46.540
Kaede!
Hang on!

16:46.540 --> 16:47.660
Hurry!

16:49.910 --> 16:51.660
That's enough.

16:51.660 --> 16:54.540
At this rate, you'll also...

16:54.540 --> 16:56.160
The Shikigami!

16:56.160 --> 16:57.330
No!

16:57.330 --> 16:59.450
I'll never let go!

16:59.450 --> 17:01.200
Concentrate on the spell!

17:02.750 --> 17:05.660
No!

17:13.080 --> 17:14.500
Look, Tsubaki!

17:25.620 --> 17:28.910
This is... magic?

17:31.200 --> 17:33.000
I made it in time...

17:36.410 --> 17:38.540
Thank you so much for everything.

17:38.540 --> 17:40.080
I'm just glad you're okay.

17:40.080 --> 17:42.290
Don't make us worry so much.

17:42.290 --> 17:43.290
Okay...

17:43.290 --> 17:47.290
Honestly. You're so useless without me around.

17:47.290 --> 17:49.450
Kaede...

17:49.450 --> 17:51.250
I'm sorry.

17:51.250 --> 17:54.290
I just really wanted to make up with you.

18:00.500 --> 18:01.750
Me, too.

18:01.750 --> 18:02.910
Huh?

18:02.910 --> 18:06.500
I wanted to make things better with you, too.

18:06.500 --> 18:09.370
But I was just so scared...

18:09.370 --> 18:13.450
I didn't know if it'd be
possible to incorporate

18:13.450 --> 18:15.620
Yamato music into our rock music...

18:16.870 --> 18:21.080
But I thought you'd think
I was a coward if I said that.

18:22.290 --> 18:24.450
I understand how you feel.

18:24.450 --> 18:27.250
I'm very scared, too.

18:28.830 --> 18:31.160
You are?

18:31.160 --> 18:36.620
Even then, I want to walk down
this path that has yet to be travelled.

18:36.620 --> 18:40.330
Along with you and Tsubaki.

18:40.330 --> 18:42.620
Nadeshiko...

18:42.620 --> 18:46.830
Because that's what rock and roll means to me!

18:46.830 --> 18:50.450
And I want to sing with you, too, Nadeshiko.

18:53.580 --> 18:55.790
Well done, my beloved sisters.

18:55.790 --> 18:58.830
I wuv, wuv, wuv you to pieces.

18:58.830 --> 19:00.040
Tsubaki...

19:00.040 --> 19:01.040
Stop...

19:01.040 --> 19:02.830
It's dangerous here.

19:02.830 --> 19:07.080
Don't worry. If something happens,
I'm sure that Tiara will save us again.

19:07.080 --> 19:08.500
Wait, me?!

19:10.160 --> 19:11.790
You guys sure are close.

19:17.830 --> 19:19.080
I'm seeing them for the first time.

19:20.500 --> 19:22.290
I'm so excited.

19:22.290 --> 19:23.620
Thank you very much

19:23.620 --> 19:28.540
for gathering to hear
Konohana wa Otome's new song tonight.

19:29.950 --> 19:32.040
This is more of a rehearsal, but...

19:32.040 --> 19:37.160
We have been reborn to bring you
some <i>wabi-sabi </i>rock!

19:37.160 --> 19:39.160
Are we really going to do this?

19:39.160 --> 19:43.080
Why not? Nadeshiko worked really hard on this.

19:46.660 --> 19:48.790
Even if it's our destiny to wither someday...

19:48.790 --> 19:51.290
We shall make this melody bloom!

19:51.290 --> 19:54.200
We offer you this song of love!

19:54.200 --> 19:57.870
We are three sisters from Yamato!

19:57.870 --> 19:59.790
Konohana wa Otome!

19:59.790 --> 20:00.950
Shall go forth!

20:26.300 --> 20:29.500
haruka na akibare no sora takaku sakebe

20:26.300 --> 20:29.500
Shout high up in the clear autumn sky

20:29.500 --> 20:32.700
ou, hai! ou, hai!

20:29.500 --> 20:32.700
Hurrah! Hurrah!

20:32.700 --> 20:35.900
harakaratachi no koe nami to oshiyoseru

20:32.700 --> 20:35.900
The voices of my people, surging with the waves

20:35.900 --> 20:39.100
ou, hai! ou, hai!

20:35.900 --> 20:39.100
Hurrah! Hurrah!

20:39.100 --> 20:42.300
matsuri ga hajimareba daremo ga nakama sa

20:39.100 --> 20:42.300
When the festival starts, we're all in this together

20:42.300 --> 20:45.500
benisasu odoriko ni sasowareru ga mama

20:42.300 --> 20:45.500
Invited by the crimson donned dancers

20:45.500 --> 20:48.600
yagura kumiage iza tanto sawageyo

20:45.500 --> 20:48.600
Let's build up the tower and make some noise

20:48.600 --> 20:51.800
mae utae subete wo wasurete

20:48.600 --> 20:51.800
Dance, sing, forget everything

20:51.800 --> 20:55.000
ame arare ase wo hikarasete

20:51.800 --> 20:55.000
Raining down, sweat glistening

20:55.000 --> 20:59.100
koe kawase warera tsunagu enishi

20:55.000 --> 20:59.100
Let us speak to each other, let us connect

20:59.100 --> 21:01.400
yumeyume kanshashite

20:59.100 --> 21:01.400
Dream on and be grateful

21:01.400 --> 21:04.600
karakurenai momiji no nishiki e

21:01.400 --> 21:04.600
Towards the red autumn coloured nishiki

21:04.600 --> 21:07.800
kaze yo fuke konomama asa made

21:04.600 --> 21:07.800
O wind, keep blowing until dawn

21:07.800 --> 21:11.900
mae utae sono te hirogetanara

21:07.800 --> 21:11.900
Dance, sing, if you extend your hand

21:11.900 --> 21:19.300
hitotsu ni nareruyo kami no manimani

21:11.900 --> 21:19.300
We can unite, in the will of the gods

21:19.300 --> 21:27.100
odore night fever

21:19.300 --> 21:27.100
Dance, night fever

21:37.540 --> 21:40.330
Konohana is like totally awesome!

21:41.750 --> 21:43.330
Kaede!

21:44.790 --> 21:46.200
Konohana rocks!

21:46.200 --> 21:47.540
This just might work!

21:47.540 --> 21:50.910
Our next Orchestra is going to be a hit!

21:50.910 --> 21:53.700
I feel a lot more confident now.

21:55.330 --> 21:58.080
I feel like I got a lot of energy from them.

21:58.080 --> 22:00.540
It feels like a flower bloomed within my heart.

22:00.540 --> 22:04.370
Yes. My chest is feeling rather warm, too.

22:04.370 --> 22:07.290
This must be the power of songs!

22:20.880 --> 22:30.780
mado no soto wa yasashii tsukiakari sotto

22:20.880 --> 22:30.780
Outside the window, the gentle moonlight is shining softly

22:30.780 --> 22:39.480
akari keshite yume no hashi wo watarou

22:30.780 --> 22:39.480
Put out the lights and cross the bridge of dreams

22:39.480 --> 22:44.280
kie soude kienai hikari ga ima

22:39.480 --> 22:44.280
The weakening yet everlasting light is now

22:44.280 --> 22:49.080
mabuta no mukou no sekai ni hirogatta

22:44.280 --> 22:49.080
Spreading out into the world behind my eyelids

22:49.080 --> 22:51.780
ironna omoi ga afurete

22:49.080 --> 22:51.780
Various feelings are overflowing

22:51.780 --> 22:55.530
kirakira mabushiku kagayaiteru

22:51.780 --> 22:55.530
sparklingly and dazzlingly shining

22:55.530 --> 22:58.680
zutto

22:55.530 --> 22:58.680
Forever

22:58.680 --> 23:00.780
It's shining stars

23:00.780 --> 23:05.580
ashita wa donna hi ni naru kana

23:00.780 --> 23:05.580
I wonder what kind of day tomorrow will be

23:05.580 --> 23:10.680
kokoro ni utsushidasu keshiki wa

23:05.580 --> 23:10.680
The scenery that is reflected in my heart

23:10.680 --> 23:15.630
kitai namida yume no zenbu ga kasanatta

23:10.680 --> 23:15.630
Expectations, tears, and dreams, all of it bottled up in my heart

23:15.630 --> 23:19.230
watashi no planetarium

23:15.630 --> 23:19.230
My planetarium

23:19.230 --> 23:19.980
hora

23:19.230 --> 23:25.080
Look, in that star that is shining the brightest

23:19.980 --> 23:25.080
ichiban kagayaiteiru ano hoshi ni

23:25.080 --> 23:29.280
negai kakete oyasumi

23:25.080 --> 23:29.280
A wish is enclosed: "Good night"
